## Plan contents

Use the supplied task and loop template to fill in completion conditions with IDs and the required stages.
Remove unrelated stages and select any necessary research or prototyping from the template candidates. Specify each check's target and completion condition IDs.
Fill in task-specific irreversible decisions and declarations of required external operations. Use values confirmed in the inputs for each external operation's kind, target, input hash, registration definition hash, and executable content hash.
Report additions of stages outside the candidates, removal of gates, changes to transitions, and removal of required checks as deviations. Deviations and declarations of external operations require human approval.
For a revised proposal, incorporate human revision instructions and check findings. For replanning, rebuild the supplied remaining work.

